%% State 07a — User soft-deletion overlay
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Updated 2026-07-27 (code-verified).
%% Scope: users.deleted_at only; orthogonal to users.status.

stateDiagram-v2
direction LR
    [*] --> retained : deleted_at is null
    retained --> soft_deleted : softDeleteUser [superadmin] / set deleted_at
    soft_deleted --> [*] : active reads exclude record

    note right of soft_deleted
        Soft deletion preserves account data.
        It does not rewrite active/inactive/suspended status.
    end note

